        "raw": "<tr id=\"S3.T5.3.5\" class=\"ltx_tr\">\n<td id=\"S3.T5.3.5.1\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top\" style=\"padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.1.1\" class=\"ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top\" style=\"width:46.9pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_p ltx_align_left\"><span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.1.1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_text\" style=\"font-size:70%;\">Insurance</span></span>\n</span></td>\n<td id=\"S3.T5.3.5.2\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top\" style=\"padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.2.1\" class=\"ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top\" style=\"width:111.0pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.2.1.1\" class=\"ltx_p ltx_align_left\"><span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.2.1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_text\" style=\"font-size:70%;\">Decide whether Medical Payments and UMBI apply after a highway collision involving a full-time RV.</span></span>\n</span></td>\n<td id=\"S3.T5.3.5.3\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top\" style=\"padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.3.1\" class=\"ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top\" style=\"width:119.5pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.3.1.1\" class=\"ltx_p ltx_align_left\"><span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.3.1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_text\" style=\"font-size:70%;\">Exclusions remove a vehicle used as a residence from the “uninsured motor vehicle” definition and bar medical-payments coverage for injuries it causes.</span></span>\n</span></td>\n<td id=\"S3.T5.3.5.4\" class=\"ltx_td ltx_align_left\" style=\"padding-left:3.5pt;padding-right:3.5pt;\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.4.1\" class=\"ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top\">\n<span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.4.1.1\" class=\"ltx_p ltx_align_left\"><span id=\"S3.T5.3.5.4.1.1.1\" class=\"ltx_text\" style=\"font-size:70%;\">Reading stops at the insuring agreement; the exclusions are missed and coverage is granted incorrectly.</span></span>\n</span></td></tr>",
